<title>USA: Redwood Empire sees Q3 loss from SAIF.</title>
<headline>Redwood Empire sees Q3 loss from SAIF.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redwood Empire Bancorp said Tuesday that it will report a loss for the third quarter as a result of recent federal Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization legislation.</p>
<p>The company said its Allied Bank subsidiary will see a pre-tax charge of $2,241,000, or $1,300,000 after-tax, in the third quarter for SAIF.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to report third quarter results the week of October 21st.</p>
</text>
